r />Thus, maximum potential difference<br /><math><msub><mrow><mi>V</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>L</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi>L</mi></msqrt><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mi>L</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>B</mi><mi>L</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#952;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac></mfenced><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>g</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>/</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>",
